  "fullDescription": "A sweet kawaii strawberry birthday clipart bundle featuring 59 adorable animals, birthday elements, numbers, decorations and berry-themed lettering. Perfect for baby shower designs, first birthday invitations, party printables, stickers, nursery art, sublimation, Cricut projects and cute kids’ designs.\n\nCreate the sweetest strawberry-themed birthday designs with this kawaii berry clipart bundle.\n\nThis collection includes 59 high-quality illustrations in PNG and SVG formats, featuring cute animals, strawberry birthday elements, numbers, decorative accents and berry-themed lettering. The artwork is designed in a soft pastel kawaii style with a sweet strawberry aesthetic, perfect for children’s birthdays, baby shower projects, nursery decor, stickers, invitations and party printables.\n\nWHAT’S INCLUDED:\n\n• 59 individual clipart elements\n• PNG files with transparent background\n• SVG files\n• High-resolution artwork\n• Cute strawberry birthday animals\n• Birthday cake, cupcake, candle, gift, banner and party elements\n• Numbers 0–9 in matching berry style\n• Decorative strawberries, bows, hearts, cloud and baby elements\n• Berry-themed lettering designs\n\nPERFECT FOR:\n\n• Birthday invitations\n• First birthday party designs\n• Baby shower printables\n• Nursery wall art\n• Stickers and planner stickers\n• Cupcake toppers\n• Party decorations\n• Sublimation designs\n• Cricut and Silhouette projects\n• Scrapbooking\n• Greeting cards\n• Kids’ apparel\n• Printable party bundles\n• Etsy digital product designs\n\nSTYLE:\n\nSoft pastel kawaii, strawberry theme, cute animals, sweet baby aesthetic, pink berry party style, clean clipart design.\n\nFILES:\n\nYou will receive PNG and SVG files packed in a ZIP folder.\n\nPlease note: this is a digital product. No physical item will be shipped.",
